    "Corporation is an interesting feature of Bitburner. It's the most profitable feature in the game, and it's so overpowered that many BitNodes tend to apply a penalty modifier. However, it's extremely complex and opaque for newbies. There are too many mechanisms that are intertwined with each other, so it's very easy to make a mistake, and that mistake can cripple your corporation. This documentation explains all the mechanisms that you need to know to build a successful corporation.": "企业是 Bitburner 中一项有趣的玩法。它是全游戏最赚钱的系统，强到许多 BitNode 都会对其施加惩罚系数。但对新手而言它极其复杂晦涩：机制太多且彼此交织，很容易犯错，而一个错误就可能拖垮你的企业。本文档讲解打造成功企业所需了解的全部机制。",
