    "Corporation's valuation is the mean of last 10 cycles' valuations.": "企业估值为最近 10 个周期估值的平均值。",
    "Bribing faction for reputation is unlocked when corporation's valuation is greater than or equal to 100e12. Exchange rate: 1e9/reputation.": "企业估值 ≥ 100e12 时解锁花钱买派系声望。汇率：1e9/声望。",
    "There are 4 investment rounds.": "投资共有 4 轮。",
