    "In each investment round, investors take a percentage of initial owned shares. The percentage of each round is in ": "每一轮融资，投资人都会按一定比例拿走初始持股。各轮比例见",
    "If your corporation is self-funded and you sell CEO position, you only need 50b to create next corporation.": "若企业为自筹且你卖掉 CEO 职位，那么创建下一家企业只需 50b。",
