    "Sell shares:": "出售股份：",
    "We cannot sell all our shares.": "不能卖光全部持股。",
    "Cooldown is 1 hour.": "冷却时间 1 小时。",
    "Buy back shares:": "回购股份：",
    "We can only buy back shares that were issued. The shares that were owned by government (when we use seed money) and investors cannot be bought back.": "只能回购已发行的股份；政府持股（使用启动资金时）与投资人的股份无法回购。",
    "Shares must be bought back at a 10% premium over the market price.": "回购价须高于市价 10%。",
    "We cannot use corporation's funds to buy back shares. They must be bought with our money.": "不能动用企业资金回购，必须自掏腰包。",
    "Sold/bought back shares are processed in multiple \"iterations\".": "卖出/回购的股份分多次\"迭代\"处理。",
    "Share price is recalculated each iteration.": "每次迭代重算股价。",
    "dummy division": "工具部门",
    // ---- corporation/product.md ----
    "The product industry is much better than the material industry in the late phases because we can sell products at ridiculously high prices.": "后期产品型行业远胜材料型行业，因为产品能卖出天价。",
    "Products need to be developed before being produced. We can put multiple products in the development queue, but only one product can be developed at a time.": "产品须先研发再生产。开发队列可排多个产品，但同一时间只能开发一个。",
    "We need to continuously develop new products. New products are almost always better than the old ones and generate much more profit.": "要持续开发新产品。新品几乎总是更好、利润高得多。",
    "The product's markup and rating are based on:": "产品的加价倍率与评级取决于：",
    "RP. This is why we should stock up on RP.": "研究点（RP）。所以要囤 RP。",
    "Design investment and advertising investment. Game UI shows them as \"Design investment\" and \"Marketing investment\". These two investments are not too important because their exponents in the formulas are very low. It's fine to use only 1% of current funds for them.": "设计投入与广告投入：游戏 UI 中显示为 \"Design investment\" 与 \"Marketing investment\"。两者不太重要——公式中指数极低，各用当前资金的 1% 即可。",
