    " → Higher raw production → More produced materials/products → Higher profit per city → Higher total profit.": " → 原始产量越高 → 产出越多 → 单城利润越高 → 总利润越高。",
    "Expanding to 6 cities means ": "扩张到 6 座城市意味着",
