    ", we need to buy boost materials. The problem is how much we should buy each material, given a specific constraint on storage space.": "，就得购买加成材料。问题是：在给定存储空间约束下，每种材料各买多少。",
    "Each boost material has a coefficient (\"factor\" in source code) and a base size (size for 1 unit in storage).": "每种加成材料都有一个系数（源码中叫 \"factor\"）和一个基础体积（1 单位的占用）。",
    "Assuming the same warehouse setup in all cities, the division production multiplier is:": "假设各城仓库配置相同，则部门生产倍率为：",
    "In order to find the maximum of the function above, we can find the maximum of this function:": "为求上式最大值，可以转求这个函数的最大值：",
