    "Type": "类型",
    "Cost": "费用",
    "Multiplier": "倍率",
    "Effect": "效果",
    "Allow exporting material between different divisions. Extremely important. Buy it at the start of round 2.": "允许在不同部门间出口材料。极其重要，第 2 轮开局就买。",
    "Enable \"Smart Supply\" feature. Only buy it if you don't implement your custom ": "启用 \"Smart Supply\" 功能。仅当你计划自写自定义",
