    "Each division has a number that I call \"Division raw production\". This raw value is the division's production capability. Let's call it ": "每个部门都有一个我称为「部门原始产量」的数值：它就是该部门的生产能力，姑且称之为",
    ". It's used for:": "。它用于：",
    "Calculating how much material/product that division can produce. It's multiplied by ": "计算部门能产出多少材料/产品：它乘以",
    " starts at 1 and is reduced if there are not enough input materials.": " 初值为 1，投入材料不足时会被削减。",
    "For example, with Agriculture, if ": "例如农业，若",
    " is 1000, we need 500 units of Water and 200 units of Chemicals. With these input materials, we can produce 1000 units of Plants and 1000 units of Food.": " 为 1000，则需 500 单位的水与 200 单位的化学品；有了这些投入，可产出 1000 单位植物与 1000 单位食物。",
